<title>UK: TENNIS-DFS CLASSIC WOMEN'S GRASS-COURT TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DFS CLASSIC WOMEN'S GRASS-COURT TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, England 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the DFS CLassic women's grass-court tennis tournament on Monday(prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Rachel McQuillan (Australia) beat Silvija Talaja (Crotia) 6-1 6-3</p>
<p>16-Larisa Neiland (Latvia) beat Rita Grande (Italy) 5-7 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>13-Tamarine Tanasugarn (Thailand) beat Meilen Tu (U.S.) 7-6 (7-5) 7-5</p>
<p>Catalina Cristea (Romania) beat Emmanuelle Gagliardi (Switzerland) 6-7 (4-7) 7-6 (7-4) 6-3</p>
<p>Kristina Brandi (U.S.) beat Miho Saeki (Japan) 6-3 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Ginger Helgeson-Nielsen (U.S.) beat Jane Chi (U.S.) 6-4 6-0</p>
<p>Naoko Kijimuta (Japan) beat Lori McNeil (U.S.) 3-6 6-4 9-7</p>
<p>Kristine Kunce (Australia) beat Marlene Weingartner (Germany) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Denisa Chladkova (Czech Republic) beat 15-Sarah Pitkowski (France) 6-3 4-6 6-1  </p>
<p>Nicole Arendt (U.S.) beat 9-Linda Wild (U.S.) 6-3 4-6 6-2</p>
<p>Laura Golarsa (Italy) beat Lea Ghirardi-Rubbi (France) 4-6 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>14-Miriam Oremans (Netherlands) beat Magdalena Grzybowska (Poland) 6-3 3-6 6-0</p>
<p>Olga Barabanschikova (Belarus) beat Siobhan Drake-Brockman (Australia) 6-4 5-7 6-1</p>
</text>
